[svelte]: https://svelte.dev/
[mdx]: https://mdxjs.com/
# mdsvex

mdsvex is a markdown preprocessor for [Svelte][svelte] components. Basically [MDX][mdx] for Svelte.

This preprocessor allows you to use Svelte components in your markdown, or markdown in your Svelte components.

mdsvex supports all Svelte syntax and its own flavour of markdown, which differs from CommonMark in a few places. See [Markdown](/docs/learn/markdown) for what is different and [limitations](/docs/reference/limitations) for what is missing.

You can do this:

```svx
<script>
	import Chart from '#lib/Chart.svelte';
</script>

# Here’s a chart

The chart is rendered inside our mdsvex document.

<Chart />
```

mdsvex has its own markdown parser, and [parse plugins](/docs/plugins/writing/parse-plugins#parse_plugins) can change the tree it builds.

[Try it](/playground)
